<td WIDTH=173 VALIGN=top><img src=http://www.beachbreak.com/images/lh_destin.jpg width=173 alt='Destinations- Beach Break' border=0 height=369><br><CENTER><FONT FACE=Arial SIZE=1><A HREF="http://www.beachbreak.com/condos/default.asp">Return Home</A></FONT></CENTER></td><td WIDTH=427 VALIGN=top><br><CENTER><H1>Beachside II - Sandestin</H1><font FACE=Arial SIZE=2></CENTER><CENTER>9300 Highway 98 West Destin FL 32550 <BR>1-3 Bedroom<BR>1-2 Bath<BR><BR><IMG SRC="http://www.beachbreak.com/property/sd/sd14.jpg" ALIGN=Absmiddle BORDER=0 ALT="Property Picture"><BR>9300 Highway 98 West Destin FL 32550 </CENTER><BR><BR>Take the finest gulf-front vacation at Sandestin Beach Resort. All the amenities of a 2,600 acre world class resort and miles of sparkling beach. There's an endless array of activities for the whole family to enjoy. You'll treasure the memories of your beachside vacation. Beachside I & II at Sandestin are located directly gulf-front, both twin towers offer magnificent views of the sugar white sand beaches and emerald green Gulf waters. Elephant Walk fine dining restaurant is located just next door. For the discriminating beach vacationer, Beachside I & II is just the place. Tram service is available throughout the resort. 
<br> <br>

-Studio, 1,2,3 bedroom units<br> 
-Fully furnished with individual washers and dryers <br>
-Pool, boardwalk, decks & balconies <br>
-2 USGA golf courses; 63-holes to fill your day <br>
-16 grass, hard or Rubico tennis courts <br>
-Boat rentals on the beach or bay: lots to enjoy <br>
-2 on-site restaurants, shopping at The Market <br>
-Air Conditioning <br>
-Balcony <br>
-Cable TV <br>
-Free Video Rental <br>
-Hot Tub <br>
-Kitchen <br>
-Linens and Towels <br>
-Pool <br>
-Poolside Bar <br>
-Restaurant <br>
-Telephone <br>
-Tennis Court <br>
-VCR <br>
-Washer/Dryer Single Unit 
 
 




